WIRE.md §8.1, DECISIONS 355: in a run with an error, canon check generates no emit for its file names: two colliding JSON emits are not reported, the error is.
-- project.canon --
project acme {
  canon: "0.1"
  roots {
    out: "out"
  }
}
-- a/a.canon --
/// A.
package a

/// V.
let v: Int = "one"

emit json { out: "@out/" }
-- b/b.canon --
/// B.
package b

/// V.
let v: Int = 2

emit json { out: "@out/" }
-- check-only --
-- findings.txt --
error[E3002]  a/a.canon:5:14
  expected Int, found String

1 error, 0 warnings in 2 packages (…)
